	(text "Rails: +VDRV → AP63205 5 V/2 A → (D3) Pico VSYS ; +5V → AP2112 ×2 → +3V3_A (sensors) and +3V3_MCU (3× AT32, flash)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3868b0cc-689a-47ca-9c3a-aa0c307916d4")
	)
	(text "FB is tied to VOUT: AP63205 is the fixed-5 V part and regulates on FB (DS Fig. 21).  EN divider 100k/20k → on ≈6.9 V, off ≈6.05 V (incl. 1.5/4 µA EN currents)."
